<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<subsection xml:id="sec-14-homework-platform-aleks">
  <title>Homework Platform: ALEKS</title>

  <p>
    This course uses ALEKS (not MyLab) for online homework and practice.
  </p>

  <p>
    ALEKS assignment deadlines and pacing are listed in Canvas. Complete work regularly instead
    of waiting until the end of the week so you have time to address questions and technical issues.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you need help with access, registration, or assignment setup in ALEKS, contact your
    instructor as soon as possible.
  </p>
</subsection>
